        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="1111" n="961" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg961"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2956/2–8.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Bryan to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-04-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 22, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 306.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your instructions No. 121, of
                    March 30 last (file No. 2956/1), in relation to the detention of Francisco
                    Freitas at Funchal, I have the honor to report that in my last interview with
                    the minister for foreign affairs he promised to hasten the release of Freitas if
                    the facts were as I stated them, and, in any event, to have him promptly
                    liberated.</p>
                <p>I transmit herewith a copy of my note to the minister on this subject.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Page
                    Bryan.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d333-a1.xml" xpointer="d333-a1"/>
            </div>
